  "title": "Brown Sugar Banana Nut Bread",
  "description": "This brown sugar banana nut bread recipe makes a moist, sweet loaf full of rich vanilla flavor—a homemade classic perfect for sharing.",
  "authors": [
    "J R May"
  ],
